/* ucstream MODULE (primary-module-interface) */
/* charset=ISO8859-1 */
/* lang=C++20 */

/* file stream operations for LIBUC */
/* version %I% last-modified %G% */


/* revision history:

	= 2011-04-12, David A­D­ Morano
